---
// src/pages/en/trust.astro
// Trust & Compliance Pack: 2-Tier Architecture (Tier 1 Public Direct Download + Tier 2 Institutional Audit Pack)
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import "../../styles/global.css";
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="alternate icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Trust & Compliance Pack (DPA, FERPA, SDPC, GDPR, EU AI Act, Zero-PII) | ColabEdu.net</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Two-tier institutional compliance pack: direct download of GDPR Art. 28 DPA, US FERPA/COPPA/SDPC NDPA v2.1 Addendum, EU AI Act Transparency Sheet, Chrome MV3 Security One-Pager, plus CISO/DPO Institutional Audit Pack (IT Stack Whitepaper, DPIA, HECVAT/ENS, VPAT).">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style is:global>
        :root {
            --font-sans: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
            --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        }
        body {
            font-family: var(--font-sans);
            background-color: #FAF9F6;
            color: #0F172A;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }
        .precision-card {
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
            border-radius: 1.25rem;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 3px 0 rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <Header lang="en" currentPath="/en/trust" />

    <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 space-y-12">
        <section class="text-center space-y-4">
            <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200 text-teal-800 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
                60-Second Institutional Verification · Zero-PII Architecture
            </span>
            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900">
                Trust &amp; Compliance Pack
            </h1>
            <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                Sign-ready legal agreements and technical security documentation organized in two tiers for School District CISOs, IT Directors, and Data Protection Officers (DPOs).
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 pt-2 text-xs font-semibold">
                <a href="/en/privacy" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 hover:border-teal-500 transition">
                    Privacy Policy &amp; COPPA Notice &rarr;
                </a>
                <a href="/en/terms" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 hover:border-teal-500 transition">
                    Terms of Service (ToS) &amp; AUP &rarr;
                </a>
                <a href="/en/data-sovereignty-privacy" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 hover:border-teal-500 transition">
                    Data Sovereignty Doctrine &rarr;
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div class="precision-card p-6 space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-900">1. Anonymous Classroom Mode &amp; ZeroPiiLlmGateway</h2>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                    In Anonymous Classroom Mode (<code>shared/pii_anonymizer.js</code>), real student names never leave the teacher's browser (mapped in <code>chrome.storage.local</code> to <code>stu_001</code>). On the backend, the mandatory <code>ZeroPiiLlmGateway</code> scrubs names, emails, SSNs/IDs, and EXIF/PDF metadata, while <code>ephemeralZeroRetention</code> deletes temporary media files in a <code>finally</code> block immediately after scoring.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="precision-card p-6 space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-900">2. EU AI Act &amp; Zero Foundation Model Training</h2>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                    Mandatory Human-in-the-Loop oversight (EU AI Act Art. 14): grades and rubric feedback require explicit educator review and use 100% demographic-blind grading (<code>[STUDENT_stu_001]</code>). Student voice recordings, handwriting, and essays are never used to train foundation AI models.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="precision-card p-6 space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-900">3. Chrome MV3 Least-Privilege &amp; Cookie-Less LTI 1.3</h2>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                    No <code>&lt;all_urls&gt;</code> and zero remote code execution (<code>eval</code> forbidden). Production builds request self-hosted <code>.edu</code>/<code>.org</code> LMS origins only on demand via <code>optional_host_permissions</code> and support third-party-cookie-free LTI 1.3 Advantage launches on managed Chromebooks.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="precision-card p-6 space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-900">4. Regional Data Sovereignty (US / EU) &amp; Zero-PII Logging</h2>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                    Strict multi-tenant isolation with PostgreSQL <em>Row-Level Security (RLS)</em>, AES-256 KMS BYOK encrypted identity vault, production <code>colabedu.ai.log-payloads=false</code> masking, and physical data residency in Iowa/Virginia (US — FERPA/COPPA/SDPC) or Frankfurt (EU — GDPR/LOPDGDD).
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- TIER 1: 100% PUBLIC ACCESS & DIRECT DOWNLOAD -->
        <section class="precision-card p-8 space-y-6 border-teal-200">
            <div>
                <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">
                    Tier 1 · 100% Public Access &amp; Direct Download (No Registration Required)
                </span>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">Sign-Ready DPAs, Public Policies &amp; Executive One-Pagers (PDF)</h2>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">
                    Ready for district procurement, SDPC piggybacking, Google Workspace / Intune MDM allowlist reviews, and DPO compliance records.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                <a href="/legal/ColabEdu-US-SDPC-FERPA-Exhibit.pdf" download class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-teal-500 hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition">
                    <div>
                        <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">1. US Student Data Privacy Addendum (FERPA / COPPA / SDPC)</div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Aligned with SDPC NDPA v2.1 + Exhibit E (24h District Piggybacking)</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-teal-700 font-bold text-xs px-2.5 py-1 bg-teal-100 rounded-lg shrink-0 ml-2">PDF</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/legal/ColabEdu-DPA-GDPR-EN.pdf" download class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-teal-500 hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition">
                    <div>
                        <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">2. Standard EU GDPR Art. 28 Data Processing Agreement</div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">English · Includes Annexes I–III (TOMs, EU Subprocessors) &amp; Signature Block</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-teal-700 font-bold text-xs px-2.5 py-1 bg-teal-100 rounded-lg shrink-0 ml-2">PDF</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/legal/ColabEdu-DPA-GDPR-LOPDGDD-ES.pdf" download class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-teal-500 hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition">
                    <div>
                        <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">3. Spanish GDPR Art. 28 &amp; LOPDGDD DPA (Disp. Adicional 19ª)</div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Spanish · Official DPA for Schools &amp; Ministries in Spain</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-teal-700 font-bold text-xs px-2.5 py-1 bg-teal-100 rounded-lg shrink-0 ml-2">PDF</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/legal/ColabEdu-EU-AI-Act-Transparency-Sheet.pdf" download class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-teal-500 hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition">
                    <div>
                        <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">4. EU AI Act Transparency &amp; Human Oversight Sheet</div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Bilingual EN/ES · Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 · L0 Grounding &amp; Blind Grading</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-teal-700 font-bold text-xs px-2.5 py-1 bg-teal-100 rounded-lg shrink-0 ml-2">PDF</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/legal/ColabEdu-Extension-Security-OnePager.pdf" download class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-teal-500 hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition">
                    <div>
                        <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">5. Chrome Extension MV3 &amp; LTI 1.3 Security One-Pager</div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Bilingual EN/ES · Step-by-step Google Workspace &amp; Intune Allowlist Guide</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-teal-700 font-bold text-xs px-2.5 py-1 bg-teal-100 rounded-lg shrink-0 ml-2">PDF</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/legal/ColabEdu-Privacy-Policy-and-COPPA-Notice-EN.pdf" download class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-teal-500 hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition">
                    <div>
                        <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">6. Global Privacy Policy &amp; Children's Privacy Notice (COPPA)</div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">English · <span class="underline">Read online at /en/privacy</span> or download official PDF</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-teal-700 font-bold text-xs px-2.5 py-1 bg-teal-100 rounded-lg shrink-0 ml-2">PDF</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/legal/ColabEdu-Terms-of-Service-and-AUP-EN.pdf" download class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-teal-500 hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition sm:col-span-2">
                    <div>
                        <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">7. Institutional &amp; User Terms of Service (ToS) &amp; Acceptable Use Policy (AUP)</div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">English · 100% Student/School IP Ownership, Zero AI Model Training · <span class="underline">Read online at /en/terms</span></div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-teal-700 font-bold text-xs px-2.5 py-1 bg-teal-100 rounded-lg shrink-0 ml-2">PDF</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- TIER 2: ADVANCED INSTITUTIONAL AUDIT PACK ON REQUEST -->
        <section class="precision-card p-8 space-y-6 bg-slate-900 text-white border-slate-800">
            <div class="space-y-2">
                <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-amber-400/20 border border-amber-400/40 text-amber-300 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide">
                    Tier 2 · Institutional Delivery Upon Request (District CISOs, IT Directors &amp; DPOs)
                </span>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white">
                    Advanced School District &amp; DPO Procurement Audit Pack
                </h2>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
                    To protect internal infrastructure blueprints from automated scraping while providing dedicated support during formal district IT vetting or public procurement, the following deep-dive audit documents are delivered upon request from an institutional email address (<code>@edu</code>, <code>@k12.*</code>, <code>@gov</code>, <code>@org</code>):
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-left">
                <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 space-y-1.5">
                    <div class="text-xs font-mono text-teal-400 font-bold">DOC-AUDIT-01 · CISO &amp; IT ARCHITECTURE</div>
                    <div class="font-bold text-white text-sm">IT Stack Architecture, Data Flow Diagram (DFD) &amp; Subprocessors Whitepaper</div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                        Full 4-layer <code>ZeroPiiLlmGateway</code> specification, regional Google Cloud vs. Alibaba Cloud / Qwen Cloud Enterprise comparison (0% PII on LLM inference), AES-256 KMS BYOK, RTO/RPO (&lt;2h / &lt;15m), and breach response (&lt;48h).
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 space-y-1.5">
                    <div class="text-xs font-mono text-teal-400 font-bold">DOC-AUDIT-02 · GDPR ART. 35 / DPO RECORD</div>
                    <div class="font-bold text-white text-sm">Pre-Completed Data Protection Impact Assessment (DPIA / EIPD) Template</div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                        Ready-to-sign GDPR Art. 35 DPIA covering necessity, proportionality, and inherent vs. residual risk scoring after <code>ZeroPiiLlmGateway</code>, <code>ephemeralZeroRetention</code>, and teacher Human-in-the-Loop controls.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 space-y-1.5">
                    <div class="text-xs font-mono text-teal-400 font-bold">DOC-AUDIT-03 · SECURITY &amp; ACCESSIBILITY</div>
                    <div class="font-bold text-white text-sm">Pre-Completed Security Questionnaires (HECVAT Lite, CAIQ, ENS) + VPAT WCAG 2.1 AA</div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                        Pre-answered HECVAT Lite / CAIQ control matrix for US K-12 districts and universities, Spanish ENS Royal Decree 311/2022 alignment, and Section 508 / EN 301 549 VPAT 2.5 accessibility report.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 space-y-1.5">
                    <div class="text-xs font-mono text-teal-400 font-bold">DOC-AUDIT-04 · THIRD-PARTY ATTESTATIONS</div>
                    <div class="font-bold text-white text-sm">Subprocessor SOC 2 Type II / ISO 27001 / ISO 27018 Certificates &amp; Regional Addenda</div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                        Verified third-party compliance certificates and sovereign regional residency attestations for US (<code>us-central1</code> / <code>us-east-1</code>) and EU (<code>europe-west3</code> / <code>eu-central-1</code> Frankfurt).
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-700/80 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-300">
                    Same-business-day delivery for School District CISOs, IT Directors, and Data Protection Officers.
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                    <a
                        href="mailto:privacy@colabedu.org?subject=Request%20Institutional%20Audit%20Pack%20(Tier%202%20-%20CISO%20%2F%20DPO)&body=Hello%20ColabEdu%20Compliance%20Team%2C%0A%0AWe%20would%20like%20to%20request%20the%20Tier%202%20Institutional%20Audit%20Pack%20(IT%20Stack%20Whitepaper%2C%20DPIA%20Template%2C%20HECVAT%2FENS%20Questionnaire%2C%20and%20VPAT)%20for%3A%0A-%20School%20District%20%2F%20Institution%3A%20%0A-%20Role%20(CISO%20%2F%20IT%20Director%20%2F%20DPO)%3A%20%0A-%20Region%20(US%20or%20EU)%3A%20"
                        class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 font-extrabold text-sm hover:bg-amber-300 transition shadow-sm"
                    >
                        🔒 Request Institutional Audit Pack
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <Footer lang="en" />
</body>
</html>
